http://www.lamemage.com/microscope/ was something we played at the
last logfest, and it's *fantastic* ; I'm not sure how this would
work online, but there are *many* shared document creators on the
web; it would just be a matter of picking one and adapting.  What
got me thinking about it was http://piratepad.net/front-page/

I think I'd be willing to subsidize a game of microscope (that is,
buy copies for people) if people took playing it in Lojban seriously
and were willing to work with me and my scheduling problems.

http://webdiplomacy.net/index.php also worked really well, and
people should play that again.

-Robin

